# Tangled Colony (3/2) attacks on turn 5 and Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2) blocks: combat damage counts as damage dealt to the Colony, so
# it dies (2 damage on a toughness of 2) and X = 2: exactly two Rats. The Bears die too (3 damage).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Tangled Colony
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tangled Colony.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Tangled Colony > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Blockers]
Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Tangled Colony)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Tangled Colony
? Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token#2.Power = 1
Bot2.Life = 20
